  "Test freeze detection. Each button blocks the UI thread differently. Check the session log - IDLE = waiting on lock/native call, PEGGED = layout or compute loop. Native Block tests the walk on a pure-native wait (no managed frames). Idle Baseline captures the stack while the UI is healthy.": {"translation":"测试卡死检测。每个按钮会以不同方式阻塞 UI 线程。请查看会话日志：IDLE = 等待锁或原生调用，PEGGED = 布局或计算循环。“原生阻塞测试”用于测试纯原生等待（没有托管栈帧）时的堆栈遍历。“空闲基线”会在 UI 正常响应时采集堆栈。","state":"machine","source_hash":"40dcf985fd3744a4d0a8456f642fde9f7651a80fcf62cff650ecebd00ce1c166"},
