  "ForceReflex: controls Reflex state when using DLSS FG.\n0 = follow in-game setting (default), 1 = force disable, 2 = force enable.": {"translation":"ForceReflex：控制使用 DLSS FG 时的 Reflex 状态。\n0 = 跟随游戏内设置（默认），1 = 强制禁用，2 = 强制启用。","state":"machine","source_hash":"5c37030344cc186cc2965d25ec950a793cb190422ec03cf26adb799d6770b6d0"},
