  "DLDSR Capture Failed": {"translation":"采集 DLDSR 失败","state":"machine","source_hash":"9a9f9ccf7dfadf6df3c0fb71e883b4c12e4bd01a36c722a453347125e23a22f1"},
  "When On, RHI will automatically configure ReShade when installing ShortFuse DLSS Tool:\n• Rename ReShade to Reshade64.asi\n• Install ASI Loader (winmm → version → dinput8)\n• Write HookStreamline=1 and HookDirectX=1 to reshade.ini\n\nThese steps are needed for FrameGen to work correctly after ReShade.\n\nNote: no longer required on ShortFuse DLSS Tool v0.54 and above.": {"translation":"开启后，安装 ShortFuse DLSS Tool 时，RHI 会自动配置 ReShade：\n• 将 ReShade 重命名为 Reshade64.asi\n• 安装 ASI Loader（winmm → version → dinput8）\n• 向 reshade.ini 写入 HookStreamline=1 和 HookDirectX=1\n\n这些步骤可确保帧生成在 ReShade 之后正常工作。\n\n注意：ShortFuse DLSS Tool v0.54 及更高版本不再需要这些步骤。","state":"machine","source_hash":"00222972b433244f40ebd9abf24030fa747dc86694529af3db42c65ec777f0b0"},
