  "Install dgVoodoo2 — deploys D3D9.dll and dgVoodoo.conf to the game folder": {"translation":"安装 dgVoodoo2：将 D3D9.dll 和 dgVoodoo.conf 部署到游戏文件夹","state":"machine","source_hash":"747d9032d22c53587a0c02943ffa67bddcc4d58054282b7e1e5343c66f930185"},
  "Neural Rendering (nvngx_dlssnr.dll)": {"translation":"神经渲染（nvngx_dlssnr.dll）","state":"machine","source_hash":"c481c3d162516102728a41fff7858a439529882c9e22651ec5e4e3c92c62cab7"},
  "How DLDSR Control Works": {"translation":"DLDSR 控制的工作原理","state":"machine","source_hash":"be00a4319c0455f61bb3fea38d56cd9d7b8921abcc0227ced3ac62d9e6c687fb"},
  "DLDSR (Deep Learning Dynamic Super Resolution) renders games at higher resolutions and downscales with AI for sharper image quality. This feature lets you switch DLDSR presets without opening NVIDIA Control Panel.\n\nDLDSR uses a Lanczos algorithm — less jaggies, more stable, but can look slightly painterly. Standard DSR uses a Gaussian filter — more natural but with more aliasing. DLDSR is generally sharper than DSR at equivalent settings.\n\nRecommended factors: DLDSR 2.25x offers the best balance of quality and performance. DSR 4.00x uses significantly more VRAM. DLDSR 1.78x is the most VRAM-friendly option.": {"translation":"DLDSR（深度学习动态超级分辨率）以更高分辨率渲染游戏，再通过 AI 缩小图像，以获得更清晰的画质。此功能让你无需打开 NVIDIA 控制面板即可切换 DLDSR 预设。\n\nDLDSR 使用 Lanczos 算法，锯齿更少、画面更稳定，但可能略带绘画感。标准 DSR 使用高斯滤波，画面更自然，但锯齿更多。在同等设置下，DLDSR 通常比 DSR 更清晰。\n\n推荐倍率：DLDSR 2.25x 在画质与性能之间最为均衡。DSR 4.00x 的显存占用明显更高。DLDSR 1.78x 是最节省显存的选项。","state":"machine","source_hash":"d006e0b06494d949db4bdb20f95f15c11e4b17f3497e99d9cd066a3380fd2ace"},
  "Deploy nvngx_dlssnr.dll 310.8.0 alongside RTX Encore for Neural Rendering support.": {"translation":"在 RTX Encore 旁部署 nvngx_dlssnr.dll 310.8.0，以支持神经渲染。","state":"machine","source_hash":"8e55b73f4921f8c203b2fec63f13fc24ec472cdfbab3b68559927a0d3ed0623c"},
  "Settings above apply in real time. Only deploy an ini if the game folder has no OptiScaler.ini yet, or you want a fresh one — it will not carry over the settings configured above.": {"translation":"上方设置会实时生效。仅当游戏文件夹尚无 OptiScaler.ini，或你想使用全新文件时，才需要部署 ini；新文件不会保留上方已配置的设置。","state":"machine","source_hash":"b5e23b97944a718c80cf686a11d2a23b07bee36d5e31999b4f1bc690cc9d2659"},
  "Using PAT · 5,000 req/hr": {"translation":"正在使用 PAT · 每小时 5,000 次请求","state":"machine","source_hash":"e1f2e06acb092792f7a9141f954bfc3ce942b2ce8093bf6c8ede601bb4c79ae1"},
  "RTX Encore Settings": {"translation":"RTX Encore 设置","state":"machine","source_hash":"af9eb9a35311f9d7b231d176cab62ee6c8bcbbe571be1a70ec37b128d2a7e600"},
