  "Enter the code above at the link — waiting for authorisation...": {"translation":"请打开链接并输入上方代码，正在等待授权...","state":"machine","source_hash":"a7a78d2c6ccdf400519be26a84b0a5708b76bad84f7cf3eb33fb319ca27f0442"},
  "Select the filename for RTX Encore. Names in use by RHI components are disabled. Amber names already have a file on disk — RHI will back it up and restore on uninstall.": {"translation":"选择 RTX Encore 的文件名。已被 RHI 组件使用的名称不可选。琥珀色名称表示磁盘上已有同名文件；RHI 会先备份，并在卸载时恢复。","state":"machine","source_hash":"5b2c8ad5db77bb3902b19aea7cf7c03ce4a7005b1fe8ecfea22338b67fd32560"},
  "Loading mod data, please wait...": {"translation":"正在加载模组数据，请稍候...","state":"machine","source_hash":"2da5e2383a016818204bb7f434b7ead814cdb886c6dba28f57a3420ac8aaed13"},
  "Connected as {0} · 5,000 req/hr": {"translation":"已连接账户 {0} · 每小时 5,000 次请求","state":"machine","source_hash":"71f6021ecd94fdccacc02e96e6d0d14c724f542487e3f18eaabbdb010f865004"},
  "Enables Frame Generation. Default (auto) is false — set to True to enable.": {"translation":"启用帧生成。默认值（自动）为 false，设为 True 即可启用。","state":"machine","source_hash":"7d310b549246d7bdfd4b763eea77b58b8019ad3cd4e64db33d4aeb377a5290f0"},
  "No DLDSR-capable monitors detected": {"translation":"未检测到支持 DLDSR 的显示器","state":"machine","source_hash":"1e407824f913757f5e41b88d3ca80517ffcd0a9dc879cc47d7edbff280c1b12b"},
  "GitHub session expired — please re-connect to restore the 5,000 req/hr limit": {"translation":"GitHub 会话已过期，请重新连接以恢复每小时 5,000 次请求的限额","state":"machine","source_hash":"ccb13a345329b62d6cbdf42526e642fc14c701bbfc58a165ac36de2010e2f1e8"},
  "Failed to save: {0}": {"translation":"保存失败：{0}","state":"machine","source_hash":"34bb2ea021bc89cefc441581850faf2dee1aad2ce402eef0d533241ac53eaeb8"},
  "Requesting device code...": {"translation":"正在请求设备代码...","state":"machine","source_hash":"143a85c23b7576d5c1622fd75295be1a299c4333aacd5b90083f0817e3daf60e"},
  "Token validation failed — check the token and try again.": {"translation":"令牌验证失败，请检查令牌后重试。","state":"machine","source_hash":"ca1b3d7027d86a6777f204002998e26154013b7cd4631a5fbdfe969f0cf7ae29"},
  "No versions available in manifest.": {"translation":"清单中没有可用版本。","state":"machine","source_hash":"69df601888ea55bf2b5b24ce0e4e4dc766bdc691253e337fb6ae26111e5f39fb"},
  "Controls the sharpening/smoothing applied during downscale. 100 = no sharpening (pure Lanczos downscale). Lower values add sharpening — the image gets progressively sharper as you reduce it.\n\nRecommended DLDSR smoothness values (from r/MotionClarity):\n  • 100 — No sharpening\n  • 80 — Sharp without artifacts\n  • 75 — Clear\n  • 65 — Clearer\n  • 55-65 — Similar clarity to DSR 4.00x at 0% (recommended range)\n  • 45 — As sharp as DSR 4.00x everywhere\n\nNote: DLDSR uses a Lanczos algorithm — it is naturally much sharper than standard DSR (Gaussian), so it requires higher smoothness values for a comparable look.\n\nChanging smoothness causes the same ~15 second display blackout as applying a full state. Tip: set smoothness first, then click Apply — both will apply together in a single restart.": {"translation":"控制缩小图像时应用的锐化/平滑程度。100 = 不锐化（仅使用 Lanczos 缩小）。数值越低，锐化越强，图像也会越来越锐利。\n\n推荐的 DLDSR 平滑度数值（来自 r/MotionClarity）：\n  • 100：不锐化\n  • 80：锐利且无伪影\n  • 75：清晰\n  • 65：更清晰\n  • 55-65：清晰度接近平滑度为 0% 的 DSR 4.00x（推荐范围）\n  • 45：各处都与 DSR 4.00x 一样锐利\n\n注意：DLDSR 使用 Lanczos 算法，本身就比标准 DSR（高斯滤波）锐利得多，因此需要更高的平滑度数值才能获得相近的观感。\n\n更改平滑度与应用完整状态一样，都会导致显示器黑屏约 15 秒。提示：先设置平滑度，再点击“应用”，即可在一次重启中同时应用两项设置。","state":"machine","source_hash":"606bf04f42ad97280ecab9a2231f286d08a906b0ae8825e509470253005541f6"},
  "Failed to apply DLDSR state. Check logs for details.": {"translation":"应用 DLDSR 状态失败。请查看日志了解详情。","state":"machine","source_hash":"382f67bce96ec19dcc1a385fed4da6a01dbd9cb549ccd30a239da9d8e8075976"},
  "Not connected · 60 req/hr": {"translation":"未连接 · 每小时 60 次请求","state":"machine","source_hash":"a04ee095a19df5fcd72d536684361bffba280da2f27a9463aede410217045e95"},
  "Smoothness Apply Failed": {"translation":"应用平滑度失败","state":"machine","source_hash":"e3238ffe4b763e70d3803099027f06da8598a5487d99b81114c54652759b82ac"},
  "NR DLL version to deploy. 'Latest' always uses the newest available. Change while installed to swap the NR DLL in-place.": {"translation":"要部署的 NR DLL 版本。“最新”始终使用当前可用的最新版本。已安装时更改此选项，会就地替换 NR DLL。","state":"machine","source_hash":"42ac59cbd21706cf2e61af3f906d320ceb8869aea44558d3a7f595bb0d67b0c5"},
