  "Failed to set DSR smoothness. Check logs for details.": {"translation":"设置 DSR 平滑度失败。请查看日志了解详情。","state":"machine","source_hash":"e6dc7855d3d453812b0f717d3a03ba54bb8420b829778779ff7d73f03de2f8b2"},
  "UseGamesReflexMarkers: whether to use the game's Reflex markers for Frame Generation timing. Default is true.": {"translation":"UseGamesReflexMarkers：是否使用游戏的 Reflex 标记来确定帧生成时机。默认值为 true。","state":"machine","source_hash":"85933ed4331506f1dcff5e9fbd0dd0c8a5435ec0c6e76d923ecefc9ae054284e"},
  "1. Open NVIDIA Control Panel → Manage 3D Settings → Global Settings\n2. Find \"DSR - Factors\" and enable the DLDSR factors you want (e.g. 1.78x DL, 2.25x DL)\n3. Click Apply and wait for the ~15 second display blackout\n4. Come back here and click \"Capture Current\" to save this state\n5. Repeat steps 2-4 for each DLDSR configuration you want to save (e.g. \"Off\", \"2.25x only\", \"1.78x + 2.25x\")": {"translation":"1. 打开 NVIDIA 控制面板 → 管理 3D 设置 → 全局设置\n2. 找到“DSR - 因数”，并启用所需的 DLDSR 倍率（例如 1.78x DL、2.25x DL）\n3. 点击“应用”，等待约 15 秒的黑屏结束\n4. 返回此处，点击“采集当前状态”以保存此状态\n5. 对每个要保存的 DLDSR 配置重复步骤 2-4（例如“关”、“仅 2.25x”、“1.78x + 2.25x”）","state":"machine","source_hash":"5557f12abdbaf3fa4c3d9a6de55b70eed7dd83091f5a85f34bb70385e492e10e"},
  "❌ Deploy failed": {"translation":"❌ 部署失败","state":"machine","source_hash":"24d9b8258f99ea2ac38320853d0ccaf74ac0ce83a9812486220bf0f6c12b7813"},
  "❤ Support the Mod Authors": {"translation":"❤ 支持模组作者","state":"machine","source_hash":"720afa77db6fd5b2fc20f987db062776cdba929ddf131fa7faca50d3423d430e"},
  "Applying...": {"translation":"正在应用...","state":"machine","source_hash":"dba1ddefd778ad652f142fd4d77ad1b779de9dbcd36b4fa6fde8c2ab94b9218a"},
  "When On, the ShortFuse addon is deployed as zzz_renodx-dlss.addon64 so it loads last in the ReShade addon order. Required for some games where other addons must initialise before the DLSS Tool.": {"translation":"开启后，ShortFuse 附加组件会部署为 zzz_renodx-dlss.addon64，使其在 ReShade 附加组件顺序中最后加载。某些游戏要求其他附加组件先于 DLSS Tool 初始化，此时需要启用此选项。","state":"machine","source_hash":"b7ab8fad535d44c1a181fffcf1ae0e1c52a2cb6532feafebfa2a8f15744d7b81"},
